Maintainer: Mixtile <dev@mixtile.com>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: rockchip-multimedia-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, udev
Description: udev rules for Rockchip multimedia device permissions
 The Rockchip VPU, the RGA 2D engine and the dma_heap allocators they share
 come up owned by root with no group access, so nothing but root can use
 hardware video decode, encode or 2D acceleration.
 .
 This package contains a udev rules file that puts those device nodes in the
 video group.
